  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently, the verification tool always logs to verify_output.txt by default.  Since the tool is not much use without logs, it would be better if logs were named with date + time stamps, so that they will never be overwritten inadvertently.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "A folder \"logs\" should be checked in to Github, but the contents gitignored. Log files can be generated automatically and stored in this form:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "logs/YYYYMMDD-HHMM.log",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
