       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3707b443358c8c223f9eec7a7d29ba88?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDB-4.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Danny Bernstein",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785e2552404d0070bf1d34",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3Abfcf2b10-5443-4304-afe6-3aff38ddf271\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"557058:bfcf2b10-5443-4304-afe6-3aff38ddf271\" data-account-id=\"557058:bfcf2b10-5443-4304-afe6-3aff38ddf271\" accountid=\"557058:bfcf2b10-5443-4304-afe6-3aff38ddf271\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Joshua Allan Westgard</a>:  I would suggest that change the \"l/log-file\"  to \"-l/-log-dir\"  parameter to specify the logs directory which will be logs/ by default.  I don't think there is any need to check in logs directory (I'm not sure that you can check in empty directories in github)</p>\n\n<p>Also: perhaps we would like to do the same for the csv files? Instead of \"-c/–csv\" option we might have a \"-o/–output-dir\" option where csv files would get dumped.</p>",
     "created": "24/May/17 2:19 PM",
     "id": "18891",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/12413/comment/18891",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "60785e2552404d0070bf1d34",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3707b443358c8c223f9eec7a7d29ba88?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDB-4.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3707b443358c8c223f9eec7a7d29ba88?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDB-4.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3707b443358c8c223f9eec7a7d29ba88?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDB-4.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3707b443358c8c223f9eec7a7d29ba88?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDB-4.png"
