  "description": "<p>Currently, the verification tool always logs to verify_output.txt by default.  Since the tool is not much use without logs, it would be better if logs were named with date + time stamps, so that they will never be overwritten inadvertently.</p>\n\n<p>A folder \"logs\" should be checked in to Github, but the contents gitignored. Log files can be generated automatically and stored in this form:</p>\n\n<p>    logs/YYYYMMDD-HHMM.log</p>",
